# alert-job-notification

Maven artifact `notification-alert-job`. Port 8019. Email/Telegram, AI queue, autoreply (Playwright/Camoufox), OTP.

Key code: `service/ai/parser/impl/*AutoreplyParser`, `service/ai/queue/`.

Build: parent install, then `../alert-job-common` install, then `mvn package` here.
